+## Future batch
+
+Only these seven cases are scheduled:
+
+1. `term-to-kill`
+2. `cleanup-denial`
+3. `probe-exception`
+4. `drain-exception`
+5. `cleanup-signal-SIGINT`
+6. `cleanup-signal-SIGTERM`
